{"path":"experimental/simd/rebind_simd","title":"std::experimental::rebind_simd, std::experimental::resize_simd","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::</span>rebind_simd, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::</span>resize_simd","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/simd/rebind_simd","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Creates a simd or simd_mask type with a different element type or size. The new type likely uses an ABI tag type different from V::abi_type.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/experimental/simd\">&lt;experimental/simd&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-parallelism_ts_2\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> V <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> rebind_simd<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-parallelism-ts-2 t-mark-ts\">(parallelism TS v2)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-parallelism_ts_2\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> N, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> V <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> resize_simd<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-parallelism-ts-2 t-mark-ts\">(parallelism TS v2)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Creates a <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/simd/simd\"><code>simd</code></a> or <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/simd/simd_mask\"><code>simd_mask</code></a> type with a different element type or size. The new type likely uses an ABI tag type different from <code>V::abi_type</code>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Changes the element type to <code>T</code> and keeps the size unchanged.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Changes the size to <code>N</code> and keeps the element type unchanged.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Template_parameters\">Template parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> T\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the new element type; an arithmetic type other than <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> N\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the new number of elements\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> V\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">simd</span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">simd_mask</span></code> type\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_types\">Member types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Name\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <code>type</code>\n</td>\n<td> <code>simd</code> or <code>simd_mask</code> type with a different element type <span class=\"t-v\">(1)</span> or size <span class=\"t-v\">(2)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Helper_types\">Helper types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-parallelism_ts_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> V <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">using</span> rebind_simd_t <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw1\">typename</span> rebind_simd<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T, V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=